; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;1)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">지도교수와 수강상담</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">승인을 받은 학생에 한하여 수강 변경</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">추가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">삭제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;2)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">변경신청강좌의 출석을 위한 수강기한</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">과제체출기한 등은 담당교수에 확인</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
